Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:52:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Organism v67 (deviation 1 to the sealed real-loop text,
 option 2): the configuration's command timeout reaches the adapter

The frozen v66 path rebuilt every external-command adapter without the configuration's delai_s
(adaptateur_commande_v64.commandes_v64), so the frozen class default of 1 800 s killed the Kimi
proposer whatever the configuration said. Five new files, nothing existing modified:
- pole/adaptateur_commande_v67.py: commandes_v67 (commandes_v64 plus delai_s from the
  configuration) and guard 24 (adapter timeout a finite number in (0, 7200] s; the command's
  --delai-s present once and at least 30 s below it);
- demonstrations/boucle_reelle_v67.py: copy of the v66 launcher; real roles through commandes_v67;
  guard 24 with the configuration content; text blocks empreintes-du-code-v67 (99 files) and
  plan-gele-v67; timeouts and launcher name in the manifest. Core, frozen reading and GO reader v66
  unchanged;
- essais/test_boucle_reelle_v67.py: the v66 launcher suite replayed against v67 under its v66 class
  names, plus new tests (sound case and artefact for every guard touched);
- essais/mutations_boucle_reelle_v67.py: the v66 bench (133) ported and 18 new mutations;
- exemples/configuration-boucle-reelle-v8.json.
Nothing run against a model.

